  "geometryBasis": "OpenStreetMap way 379876762 traces 74 controls of the named summit fort. Mapped node 9510021028 locates an upper gate, and three mapped ponds locate the larger reservoir embankments. The matched 1880 Asirgad plate constrains lower west wall lines and interior layout.",
